BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Little Hands\, Big Impact with Second Harvest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T120000
DTSTAMP:20260603T124514Z
UID:88a0c9d049c1bfe2a04fbe9efbb45610@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nJoin us and Second Harvest Food Ban
 k as we encourage little ones to be active members of society. This volunt
 eer opportunity will encourage and open the platform for children to be ab
 le to package fruits that will be sent out to real families in need in Ora
 nge County. \nTimes: 9am-12pm \nIncluded with museum admission \nActivi
 ties take place while supplies last.\nEvents and times are subject to chan
 ge.  \nAbout the play partner: Second Harvest Food Bank is a nonprofit 
 organization in Orange County dedicated to ending hunger in the community.
  Through food distribution\, community partnerships\, and volunteer progra
 ms\, Second Harvest helps ensure families across the county have access to
  nutritious food. \nFrequently Asked Questions \nIs this activity includ
 ed with museum admission?\nYes. The volunteer activity is included with 
 regular museum admission. \nWhat ages can participate?\nThis experience
  is designed for children ages 2–8 and their families. \nWhat will c
 hildren be doing?\nChildren will help package fresh fruit that will be di
 stributed to families in need throughout Orange County. \nIs this a real 
 volunteer opportunity?\nYes. The fruit packaged during the activity will b
 e distributed through Second Harvest Food Bank to real families in the co
 mmunity.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/little-hands-b
 ig-impact-with-second-harvest/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/little-hands-big-impact-with-second
 -harvest/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: Little Hands\, Big Impact with Second Harvest
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:In 2 hours: Little Hands\, Big Impact with Second Harvest
TRIGGER:-PT2H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
