SUMMARY:World Cup Kick Off with Si Sabo Kids
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T235959
DTSTAMP:20260603T124514Z
UID:00e26163da1cd392c95445670542e4a6@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nCelebrate the World Cup with a special
  storytime and activities at Pretend City featuring ¡Gooool!: A Soccer
  Book for Kids by Sí Sabo Kids. Families can enjoy soccer-themed fun\,
  meet the authors\, and attend a book signing. \nTimes:  11 am &amp\; 2:
 30 pm\n*Please note programming lasts 10-30 minutes. \nIncluded with muse
 um admission \nAbout Play Partner: Mike Alfaro is a Creative Director\, 
 Content Creator\, and Children’s Book Writer with over 400k followers 
 on social media (@millennialloteria). Recognized as one of TikTok’s 2023
  Latinx Visionary Voices\, he also earned a spot in the inaugural class of
  the LA Time’s 2022 Vanguardia List—celebrating Latino innovators\, in
 stigators\, and power players breaking through barriers. Originally from G
 uatemala\, he now resides in Los Angeles with his wife Amy and baby Mya.
  \nGerardo Guillén is a Mexican-American Creative Director and Illustr
 ator born in El Paso\, Texas. He has created award-winning advertising cam
 paigns for clients like McDonald’s\, Fiji\, Honda\, and Jack in the Box.
  (Portfolio: ElArtDirector.com) His work has been profiled by PBS\, NPR\, 
 Communication Arts\, and more. He now lives in Los Angeles with his wife G
 ina\, his sons Oli and Max. \nBooks will be available for purchase during
  the event.\nSpace may be limited. \n*Events and times are subject to cha
 nge. \nFrequently Asked Questions \nIs this event included with museum
  admission?\nYes. The program is included with regular museum admission. 
 \nWill books be available for purchase?\nYes. Copies of ¡Gooool!: A Socc
 er Book for Kids will be available for purchase during the event. \nWill
  there be a book signing?\nYes. Families will have the opportunity to meet
  the creators and participate in a book signing after the program. \n&n
 bsp\;\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/world-cup-kick-of
 f-with-si-sabo-kids/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/world-cup-kick-off-with-si-sabo-kid
 s/
