DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\n15-year old experienced baker Allie
  Su will introduce baking to our families by demonstrating how to make a s
 urprise dessert. Her puppet\, Skunky the Skunk\, will assist her as well
  as entertain the children. At the end of the demonstration\, you will hav
 e a chance to sample her (and Skunky’s) homemade dish! \nTIME: 2:30 PM
 \nAbout the play partner: \nAllie first started baking during covid-19 a
 nd it became her passion. Since then\, she has started her own bakery\, ta
 ught baking summer camps at home four years in a row\, sold her desserts a
 t a “Youth Entrepreneur Fair” four times\, and won blue and red ribbon
 s at the OC Fair for her macarons and other desserts. This is her third ti
 me presenting at Pretend City with Skunky.  \nHer website:  \nhttps://
 sites.google.com/view/sweetzbakery/home  \nInstagram:  \nhttps://www.i
 nstagram.com/allies_sweetz_bakery?igsh=aDQ2NHhsYzkzOTZs&amp\;utm_source=qr
 \\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/cooking-with-allie-and
 -skunky/
